      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.97,
      "end_seconds": 292.19,
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Okay, thinking it through, this is probably a quinsy, a peritonsillar abscess."
