      "start_seconds": 317.52,
      "end_seconds": 329.87,
      "duration_seconds": 12.35,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an urgent ENT drainage for peritonsillar abscess we'll begin with benzylpenicillin, 1.2 grams, now, single dose that's for peritonsillar abscess"
