      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.34,
      "end_seconds": 355.67,
      "duration_seconds": 21.33,
      "text": "You need to be seen by ENT today to drain it. I'm going to send a referral to the ENT team. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait. Let's review you straight away. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
